{"term": {"label": "智", "occurrences": 5, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "思", "id": "思"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "日", "id": "日"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "當", "id": "當"}, {"form": "禹", "id": "禹"}, {"form": "罪", "id": "罪"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "足", "id": "足"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.9856819377004897, "source": "死", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.3978952727983707, "source": "死", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.803360380906535, "source": "死", "target": "當"}, {"weight": 2.1102132003465894, "source": "水", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 2.580216829592325, "source": "水", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.580216829592325, "source": "水", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 3.091042453358316, "source": "水", "target": "禹"}, {"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "水", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.580216829592325, "source": "水", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.4170660197866443, "source": "當", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 2.580216829592325, "source": "當", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.992430164690206, "source": "當", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.1102132003465894, "source": "當", "target": "足"}, {"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "當", "target": "禹"}, {"weight": 1.599387576580599, "source": "何", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.1102132003465894, "source": "足", "target": "日"}, {"weight": 2.2925347571405443, "source": "足", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "足", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.599387576580599, "source": "惡", "target": "善"}, {"wei